cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Hauksbee in published work, please cite it as below. To cite one
  run, also give that run's record_id (the sha256 identifier in its
  hauksbee.run-record/1 document).
type: software
title: Hauksbee
abstract: >-
  Hauksbee reconstructs the circuit a PCB's copper implements from native
  design files, binds device models, solves it, and runs compiled firmware
  against the solved board, reporting each finding with the evidence behind it.
authors:
  - name: hauksbee-dev
version: 0.1.0-beta.6
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hauksbee-dev/hauksbee"
url: "https://github.com/hauksbee-dev/hauksbee"
keywords:
  - pcb
  - eda
  - simulation
  - kicad
  - hardware
  - firmware co-simulation
